  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Reducing the demand for deforestation-causing biofuels in Western Markets</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The  aim  of  this  project  is  to  reduce  and  eliminate  the  demand  for deforestation-causing  biofuels  in  the EU, Norway, the United States and Canada  by  changing  the  policies  that  have  led  to  this  state.</narrative>
  </description>
